        "Eimer, M., Gosling, A., Nicholas, S., & Kiss, M. (2011). The N170 component and its links to configural face processing: A rapid neural adaptation study. Brain Research, 1376, 76–87. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.brainres.2010.12.046\n",
