        "Johnston, P., Molyneux, R., & Young, A. W. (2015b). The N170 observed ‘in the wild’: Robust event-related potentials to faces in cluttered dynamic visual scenes. Social Cognitive and Affective Neuroscience, 10(7), 938–944. https://doi.org/10.1093/scan/nsu136\n",
        "Kappenman, E. S., Farrens, J. L., Zhang, W., Stewart, A. X., & Luck, S. J. (2021). ERP CORE: An open resource for human event-related potential research. NeuroImage, 225, 117465. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.neuroimage.2020.117465\n",
