        "Taubert, J., Wardle, S. G., & Ungerleider, L. G. (2020). What does a “face cell” want?’. Progress in Neurobiology, 195, 101880. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.pneurobio.2020.101880\n",
        "Yildirim-Keles, F. Z., Stacchi, L., & Caldara, R. (2025). Cross-Validating the Electrophysiological Markers of Early Face Categorization. Eneuro, 12(1), ENEURO.0317-24.2024. https://doi.org/10.1523/ENEURO.0317-24.2024\n",
